# <type>(<scope>): <description>
#
# Write in English, imperative mood, lower case, no period, max 72 chars.
# Types: feat | fix | docs | test | build | ci | refactor | style | chore | perf
# Scope is optional: citas, adr, ci, pom, docs...
#
# Body (optional): explain WHAT and WHY, not how. Wrap at 72 chars.
#
# Footer (optional): BREAKING CHANGE: <description> | Refs: #<issue>
#
# Examples:
#   feat(citas): add in-memory appointment validation
#   docs(adr): add ADR 0001 on appointment validation strategies
#   ci: add GitHub Actions workflow to run Maven tests
#
# Spec: https://www.conventionalcommits.org
